@baseUrl = http://localhost:4201
@apiVersion = 1
@domain = core

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Login + Contract (SubProcess) + Online (SubProcess ×N) orchestration
###
### Handshake (v1.1.0 — yeni updateData/lock modeli):
###   Login.start ─(SubProcess 14)→ Contract.start (contractId = Login.id)
###   Contract ─(HTTP)→ resolve N docs ─(invoke-loop, $self auto ×N SubProcess)→ Online ×N
###   Online ─(DirectTrigger 12 → Contract.updateData "contract-progress" {kind:render})→
###     Contract stamps rr_{documentId}; her kabul autos'u değerlendirir; awaiting-renders
###     gate'i TIMER'SIZ ateşlenir (park-Busy devralınır) ─(shared login-ready)→ Login
###   USER ─(pre-approve)→ each Online ─(contract-progress {kind:approval})→ Contract
###     stamps ap_{documentId} — updateData koşulsuz kabul: hızlı onayda 409/Busy YOK
###   Contract: ap_ == N ─(shared login-approvals-done)→ Login                    (ONCE)
###   USER ─(login-finalize)→ Login ─(contract-finalize)→ Contract
###   Contract: finalize-loop ($self auto ×N online-finalize) → Contract.completed
###   Contract.completed ─(updateData contract-status)→ Login.completed
###
### Yeni model notları:
###   • contract-progress workflow-level updateData'dır (target $self): Busy'de bile kabul
###     edilir, her kabulde state'in autos'u taze veriyle değerlendirilir, park-Busy devralınır.
###   • Sayaçlar yok: her callback kendi rr_/ap_{documentId} anahtarını damgalar (delta-only) —
###     eşzamanlı yazımlar ayrık anahtarlara dokunur, artış kaybı yapısal olarak imkânsız.
###   • $self auto loop'lar (invoke-loop / finalize-loop) güvenli: job adları invocation-scoped.
###   • errorBoundary errorCodes: ["409"] — status artık task hatasında taşınıyor (F5 fix).
###   • Online child key'leri deterministik: {contractInstanceId}-doc-{documentId}.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1) Start the Login flow (top-level). contractCode drives doc resolution.
# @name startLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/login-flow/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "user-123",
  "act_sub": "user-123",
  "contractCode": "CONTRACT-001"
}

### Capture the Login instance id
@loginInstanceId = {{startLogin.response.body.id}}

### 2) Poll Login state — after children auto-render and call back, Login should be at
###    "waiting-approval-doc" (shared transition login-ready fired by the contract subprocess).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/login-flow/instances/{{loginInstanceId}}/functions/state

### 3) Find the Contract subprocess instance id (Login instance data → contractInstanceId).
###    Read it from the state response above, then set it here:
@contractInstanceId = REPLACE_WITH_contractInstanceId

### 4) Inspect the Contract instance — onlineInstanceIds[] lists the started Online subprocesses.
###    renderedCount must equal documentCount (3 for CONTRACT-001); state = approval-waiting.
###    rr_ damgalari documentCount'a esitse tum render callback'leri islenmis demektir.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/contract-flow/instances/{{contractInstanceId}}/functions/state

### 5) User approves each rendered document on its Online subprocess (pre-approve).
###    Take the ids from contract.onlineInstanceIds[] above.
###    ▸ LOCK TEST: fire these three back-to-back (VS Code REST Client "Run All" / no wait between
###      them) so the three Online children hit contract-flow's contract-progress concurrently.
###      updateData kosulsuz kabul eder: ap_ damgalari 3'e yakinsar — 409/Busy penceresi yok.
@online1 = REPLACE_WITH_onlineInstanceIds_0
@online2 = REPLACE_WITH_onlineInstanceIds_1
@online3 = REPLACE_WITH_onlineInstanceIds_2

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/online-flow/instances/{{online1}}/transitions/pre-approve
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/online-flow/instances/{{online2}}/transitions/pre-approve
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/online-flow/instances/{{online3}}/transitions/pre-approve
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6) Verify Contract.approvedCount == documentCount and that the aggregate signal fired:
###    Contract → awaiting-finalize, Login → all-documents-approved.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/contract-flow/instances/{{contractInstanceId}}/functions/state

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/login-flow/instances/{{loginInstanceId}}/functions/state

### 7) User initiates the final finalize on the Login flow. This DirectTriggers
###    contract-finalize on the Contract instance, which loops online-finalize over every child.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/login-flow/instances/{{loginInstanceId}}/transitions/login-finalize
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8) Final state — Login should be at login-completed-state (login-completed fired by Contract).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/login-flow/instances/{{loginInstanceId}}/functions/state

### Contract should be at contract-completed, every Online at online-completed.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/contract-flow/instances/{{contractInstanceId}}/functions/state

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Lock-mechanism probes (manual, run against a live contract instance)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### P1) Invoke the updateData transition directly. Same endpoint shape as any transition.
###     Body {kind, documentId} — her kabul kendi rr_/ap_ damgasini basar ve autos'u degerlendirir.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/contract-flow/instances/{{contractInstanceId}}/transitions/contract-progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "render",
  "documentId": "probe-doc"
}

### P2) Same call again, immediately — this is the collision the errorBoundary is there to absorb.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/contract-flow/instances/{{contractInstanceId}}/transitions/contract-progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "render",
  "documentId": "probe-doc"
}

### P3) Re-read data after the burst: rr_probe-doc damgasi ve ardisik data versiyonlari gorulmeli.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/contract-flow/instances/{{contractInstanceId}}/functions/state

### P4) Retry a transition that failed after exhausting its errorBoundary retries.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/contract-flow/instances/{{contractInstanceId}}/retry

### ── Cancel paths (optional) ──
### PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/login-flow/instances/{{loginInstanceId}}/transitions/cancel-login
